<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>hc/place</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&display=swap');
        *, *::before, *::after{
            box-sizing:border-box;
        }
        html,body{
            margin:0;
            min-height:100%;
            background:url('paper.png') repeat;
            background-color:#FCF8E7;
            font-family:'Instrument Serif', serif;
            font-size:clamp(1rem, 1.2vw + 0.75rem, 1.2rem);
        }
        body{
            display:flex;
            flex-direction:column;
            gap:1rem;
            padding:0 clamp(0.75rem, 3vw, 3rem);
        }
        main{
            width:min(100%, 70rem);
            margin:0 auto;
        }
        .content{
            display:flex;
            flex-direction:column;
            align-items:center;
            gap:1rem;
        }
        .nav{
            display:flex;
            flex-direction:column;
            justify-content:center;
            align-items:center;
        }
        .nav img{
            display:block;
            width:min(100%, 26rem);
            height:auto;
        }
        .nav-links{
            display:flex;
            flex-wrap:wrap;
            justify-content:center;
            align-items:center;
            width:100%;
            padding:0.45rem 0.75rem;
            text-align:center;
            border-block:0.2em #000000 double;
        }
        .nav-links span{
            max-width:70rem;
        }
        a{
            color:#338eda;
            font-weight:bold;
            overflow-wrap:anywhere;
        }
        a:hover{
            color:#a633d6;
        }
        iframe{
            display:block;
            width:min(90%, 43rem);
            aspect-ratio:16 / 9;
            height:auto;
            margin:0;
            border:0;
            margin-top:1rem;
        }
        .footer{
            margin-top:auto;
        }
        .button{
            display:block;
            width:fit-content;
            max-width:100%;
            margin:0 auto;
            padding:0.5em 1em;
            background-color:#ec3750;
            color:white;
            text-decoration:none;
            text-align:center;
            border-radius:0.3em;
        }
        .button:hover{
            background-color:#a633d6;
            color:white;
        }
        .alert{
            background-color:#ec3750;
            color:white;
            text-align:center;
            padding:0.3em;
        }
        .alert a{
            color:white;
            font-weight:bold;
        }
        .alert a:hover{
            color:#ffee00;
        }
        .subtitle{
            display:block;
            text-align:center;
            max-width:48rem;
        }
        @media (max-width:30rem){
            body{
                gap:0.75rem;
                padding-inline:0.5rem;
            }
            .nav-links{
                padding-inline:0.4rem;
            }
            .alert{
                line-height:1.25;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="alert">
        I couldn't find that page, its not meant to be there, or its still a wip. You might never know ;)
    </div>
<main>
    <div class="nav">
        <img src="hcplace.svg" alt="hc/place">
        <div class="nav-links">
            <span>An unofficial community project @ HackClub. View more @ <a href="https://hackclub.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C0C12BXC7ME">#vasis-room</a></span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/NznHMCHy79s?si=Pr67Y18BRW7xiXPA" title="YouTube video player" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        <span class="subtitle">It's an empty canvas with no strings attached. Somewhere in the world, a screen is updating. and <strong>You're</strong> part of it</span>
        <a href="/place" class="button">Visit the hc/place canvas</a>
    </div>
</main>
    <div class="nav-links footer">
       <span>An unofficial project @ hackclub, view the code on <a href="https://github.com/vasipallie/hcplace">GitHub</a></span>
    </div>
</body>
</html>